Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Template Association Problems
Problem: Host group doesn't use the correct provisioning template.

Solution:

# Check template associations
hammer template list --search "name ~ kickstart"

# Verify host group template settings
hammer hostgroup info --name "web-servers"

# Re-associate template if needed
hammer hostgroup update --name "web-servers" --provisioning-template "Web Server Kickstart"
Issue 2: Parameter Inheritance Issues
Problem: Child host groups don't inherit parent parameters.

Solution:

# Check parameter inheritance
hammer hostgroup info --name "apache-servers" --show-parameters

# Verify parent-child relationships
hammer hostgroup list --show-parameters
Issue 3: PXE Boot Failures
Problem: Hosts fail to PXE boot properly.

Solution:

# Check DHCP configuration
systemctl status dhcpd

# Verify TFTP services
systemctl status tftp

# Check PXE template generation
ls -la /var/lib/tftpboot/pxelinux.cfg/
