Using External Node Classifier (ENC)
Configure Foreman as an ENC for Puppet:
# Edit puppet.conf
vim /etc/puppetlabs/puppet/puppet.conf

# Add ENC configuration
[master]
node_terminus = exec
external_nodes = /etc/puppetlabs/puppet/node.rb
Test ENC functionality:
